{"title":"BGRT","slug":"BGRT","html":"<div class=\"wk-navbox\">\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-title\">\n<p><a data-wiki=\"ACPI\" href=\"#/library/ACPI\">ACPI</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\"></span> <a data-wiki=\"RSDP\" href=\"#/library/RSDP\">RSDP</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\">Fixed Tables</span> <a data-wiki=\"BGRT\" href=\"#/library/BGRT\">BGRT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"FADT\" href=\"#/library/FADT\">FADT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"MADT\" href=\"#/library/MADT\">MADT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"RSDT\" href=\"#/library/RSDT\">RSDT</a>/<a data-wiki=\"XSDT\" href=\"#/library/XSDT\">XSDT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"SRAT\" href=\"#/library/SRAT\">SRAT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"WAET\" href=\"#/library/WAET\">WAET</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\">Differentiated Tables</span> <a data-wiki=\"DSDT\" href=\"#/library/DSDT\">DSDT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"SSDT\" href=\"#/library/SSDT\">SSDT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"AML\" href=\"#/library/AML\">AML</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\">Tools/Libs</span> <a data-wiki=\"ACPICA\" href=\"#/library/ACPICA\">ACPICA</a> · <a data-wiki=\"UACPI\" href=\"#/library/UACPI\">uACPI</a> · <a data-wiki=\"LAI\" href=\"#/library/LAI\">LAI</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The Boot Graphics Record Table (BGRT) is an optional <a data-wiki=\"ACPI\" href=\"#/library/ACPI\">ACPI</a> table which contains a pointer to the image that has been drawn during boot.</p>\n<h2 id=\"table_structure\">Table structure</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><p>Offset (hex)</p></th>\n<th><p>Length</p></th>\n<th><p>Description</p></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p>00</p></td>\n<td><p>4</p></td>\n<td><p>Signature 'BGRT'</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>04</p></td>\n<td><p>4</p></td>\n<td><p>Length of the table (in bytes, including header)</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>08</p></td>\n<td><p>1</p></td>\n<td><p>Revision</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>09</p></td>\n<td><p>1</p></td>\n<td><p>Checksum</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>0a</p></td>\n<td><p>6</p></td>\n<td><p>OEM ID</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>10</p></td>\n<td><p>8</p></td>\n<td><p>OEM Table ID</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>18</p></td>\n<td><p>4</p></td>\n<td><p>OEM Revision</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>1c</p></td>\n<td><p>4</p></td>\n<td><p>Creator ID</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>20</p></td>\n<td><p>4</p></td>\n<td><p>Creator revision</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>24</p></td>\n<td><p>2</p></td>\n<td><p>Version ID (must be 1)</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>26</p></td>\n<td><p>1</p></td>\n<td><p>Status</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>27</p></td>\n<td><p>1</p></td>\n<td><p>Image type</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>28</p></td>\n<td><p>8</p></td>\n<td><p>Image address</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>30</p></td>\n<td><p>4</p></td>\n<td><p>Image X offset</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>34</p></td>\n<td><p>4</p></td>\n<td><p>Image Y offset</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h2 id=\"fields\">Fields</h2>\n<h3 id=\"status\">Status</h3>\n<p>Indicates the image's status.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><p>Bits</p></th>\n<th><p>Description</p></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p>0</p></td>\n<td><p>Displayed</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>1:2</p></td>\n<td><p>Orientation offset</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>3:7</p></td>\n<td><p>Reserved (must be 0)</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>Orientation offset:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>0b00: no offset</li>\n<li>0b01: 90º</li>\n<li>0b10: 180º</li>\n<li>0b11: 270º</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"image_type\">Image type</h3>\n<p>0: Image is a bitmap</p>\n<p>1-255: Reserved</p>\n<h3 id=\"image_address\">Image address</h3>\n<p>64-bit physical address to an in-memory copy of the displayed image. It can be a 24 bit bitmap (0xRRGGBB) or a 32 bit bitmap (0xrrRRGGBB), where lowercase R means reserved.</p>\n<h3 id=\"image_offsets\">Image offsets</h3>\n<p>Describes the offsets to the (X, Y) of the screen for the top left image corner.</p>\n","toc":[{"id":"table_structure","text":"Table structure","level":2},{"id":"fields","text":"Fields","level":2},{"id":"status","text":"Status","level":3},{"id":"image_type","text":"Image type","level":3},{"id":"image_address","text":"Image address","level":3},{"id":"image_offsets","text":"Image offsets","level":3}],"categories":["ACPI"],"rating":null,"flags":[],"words":217,"summary":"The Boot Graphics Record Table (BGRT) is an optional ACPI table which contains a pointer to the image that has been drawn during boot.","updated":"2024-06-07","authors":["Melina148","Nightishaman"],"url":"https://wiki.osdev.org/BGRT","history":"https://wiki.osdev.org/index.php?title=BGRT&action=history","backlinks":[{"t":"ACPI","s":"ACPI"},{"t":"ACPICA","s":"ACPICA"},{"t":"AML","s":"AML"},{"t":"DSDT","s":"DSDT"},{"t":"FADT","s":"FADT"},{"t":"LAI","s":"LAI"},{"t":"MADT","s":"MADT"},{"t":"RSDP","s":"RSDP"},{"t":"RSDT","s":"RSDT"},{"t":"SRAT","s":"SRAT"},{"t":"SSDT","s":"SSDT"},{"t":"UACPI","s":"UACPI"},{"t":"XSDT","s":"XSDT"}],"lessons":[]}